nh từ dân dụng, thương mại đến cao ốc văn phòng, khách sạn, bệnh viện.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1249&quot; data-start=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1249&quot; data-start=&quot;1062&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1075&quot; data-start=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Tầm nhìn:&lt;/strong&gt; Trở thành thương hiệu &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1129&quot; data-start=&quot;1098&quot;&gt;thang máy hàng đầu Việt Nam&lt;/strong&gt;, có mặt trong hầu hết các công trình dân dụng và thương mại, không chỉ tại TP.HCM mà còn vươn ra các tỉnh thành khác.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1254&quot; data-start=&quot;1251&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1291&quot; data-start=&quot;1256&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;✅ Giá trị cốt lõi của Nhân Phát&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol data-end=&quot;1696&quot; data-start=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1365&quot; data-start=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1365&quot; data-start=&quot;1295&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1305&quot; data-start=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;Uy tín&lt;/strong&gt; – Đặt lợi ích và sự hài lòng của khách hàng lên hàng đầu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1465&quot; data-start=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1465&quot; data-start=&quot;1369&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1383&quot; data-start=&quot;1369&quot;&gt;Chất lượng&lt;/strong&gt; – Mỗi sản phẩm thang máy được kiểm định nghiêm ngặt, đảm bảo độ bền và an toàn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1539&quot; data-start=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1539&quot; data-start=&quot;1469&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1480&quot; data-start=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;Đổi mới&lt;/strong&gt; – Luôn cập nhật công nghệ mới, giải pháp lắp đặt tối ưu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1619&quot; data-start=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1619&quot; data-start=&quot;1543&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1560&quot; data-start=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;Chuyên nghiệp&lt;/strong&gt; – Đội ngũ kỹ sư, kỹ thuật viên có nhiều năm kinh nghiệm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1696&quot; data-start=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1696&quot; data-start=&quot;1623&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1642&quot; data-start=&quot;1623&quot;&gt;Hậu mãi tận tâm&lt;/strong&gt; – Dịch vụ bảo trì, bảo dưỡng nhanh chóng, kịp thời.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1701&quot; data-start=&quot;1698&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1749&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;🔧 Dịch vụ nổi bật tại Thang Máy Nhân Phát&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2097&quot; data-start=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1810&quot; data-start=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1810&quot; data-start=&quot;1752&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1783&quot; data-start=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;Tư vấn &amp; thiết kế thang máy&lt;/strong&gt; theo yêu cầu công trình.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1939&quot; data-start=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1939&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1834&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot;&gt;Lắp đặt thang máy&lt;/strong&gt;: thang máy gia đình, thang máy tải khách, thang máy tải hàng, thang máy bệnh viện, thang máy quan sát…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2021&quot; data-start=&quot;1940&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2021&quot; data-start=&quot;1942&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1965&quot; data-start=&quot;1942&quot;&gt;Bảo trì – bảo dưỡng&lt;/strong&gt; định kỳ, đảm bảo thang máy vận hành ổn định, an toàn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2097&quot; data-start=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2097&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2046&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot;&gt;Nâng cấp – cải tạo&lt;/strong&gt; thang máy cũ, thay thế linh kiện chất lượng cao.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;2102&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;2139&quot; data-start=&quot;2104&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;🌟 Điểm khác biệt của Nhân Phát&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2471&quot; data-start=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2220&quot; data-start=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2220&quot; data-start=&quot;2142&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2165&quot; data-start=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Giải pháp trọn gói:&lt;/strong&gt; Từ khâu khảo sát, thiết kế, lắp đặt cho đến bảo trì.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2294&quot; data-start=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2294&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2244&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot;&gt;Giá thành hợp lý:&lt;/strong&gt; Cạnh tranh, minh bạch, phù hợp nhiều phân khúc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2374&quot; data-start=&quot;2295&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2374&quot; data-start=&quot;2297&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2317&quot; data-start=&quot;2297&quot;&gt;Cam kết an toàn:&lt;/strong&gt; Sản phẩm đạt tiêu chuẩn an toàn quốc tế, có kiểm định.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2471&quot; data-start=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2471&quot; data-start=&quot;2377&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2406&quot; data-start=&quot;2377&quot;&gt;Thời gian thi công nhanh:&lt;/strong&gt; Đảm bảo tiến độ, không ảnh hưởng đến hoạt động của công trình.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;2476&quot; data-start=&quot;2473&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-end=&quot;2684&quot; data-start=&quot;2478&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;👉 Với phương châm: &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2547&quot; data-start=&quot;2498&quot;&gt;“Đưa thang máy chất lượng đến mọi công trình”&lt;/strong&gt;, Thang Máy Nhân Phát đã trở thành đối tác tin cậy của nhiều chủ đầu tư, doanh nghiệp và hộ gia đình tại TP.HCM và các khu vực lân cận.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;80&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Lắp đặt thang máy Quận Tân Bình – Xu hướng tất yếu cho công trình hiện đại&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=&quot;466&quot; data-start=&quot;82&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Quận Tân Bình được xem là một trong những quận trung tâm, phát triển năng động của TP.HCM. Với mật độ dân cư đông đúc, nhiều công trình nhà ở, khách sạn, văn phòng, trung tâm thương mại liên tục mọc lên, nhu cầu &lt;strong data-end=&quot;333&quot; data-start=&quot;294&quot;&gt;lắp đặt thang máy tại Quận Tân Bình&lt;/strong&gt; ngày càng tăng cao. Đây không chỉ là giải pháp giúp tiết kiệm thời gian di chuyển mà còn góp phần nâng tầm giá trị cho công trình.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;471&quot; data-start=&quot;468&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;529&quot; data-start=&quot;473&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;🚪 Vì sao nên lắp đặt thang máy tại Quận Tân Bình?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol data-end=&quot;1278&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;700&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;558&quot; data-start=&quot;534&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;556&quot; data-start=&quot;534&quot;&gt;Tiện ích vượt trội&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n	&lt;ul data-end=&quot;700&quot; data-start=&quot;562&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;630&quot; data-start=&quot;562&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;630&quot; data-start=&quot;564&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Giúp việc di chuyển giữa các tầng dễ dàng, nhanh chóng, an toàn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;700&quot; data-start=&quot;634&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;700&quot; data-start=&quot;636&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Đặc biệt hữu ích cho người cao tuổi, trẻ em, phụ nữ mang thai.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;892&quot; data-start=&quot;702&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;744&quot; data-start=&quot;705&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;742&quot; data-start=&quot;705&quot;&gt;Tối ưu không gian sống &amp; làm việc&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n	&lt;ul data-end=&quot;892&quot; data-start=&quot;748&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;834&quot; data-start=&quot;748&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;834&quot; data-start=&quot;750&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Các mẫu &lt;strong data-end=&quot;788&quot; data-start=&quot;758&quot;&gt;thang máy gia đình nhỏ gọn&lt;/strong&gt; phù hợp với nhà phố, biệt thự tại Tân Bình.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;892&quot; data-start=&quot;838&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;892&quot; data-start=&quot;840&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Tạo điểm nhấn sang trọng, hiện đại cho công trình.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1071&quot; data-start=&quot;894&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;932&quot; data-start=&quot;897&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;930&quot; data-start=&quot;897&quot;&gt;Gia tăng giá trị bất động sản&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n	&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1071&quot; data-start=&quot;936&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;1016&quot; data-start=&quot;936&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;1016&quot; data-start=&quot;938&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Nhà có thang máy luôn được đánh giá cao hơn khi giao dịch mua bán, cho thuê.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;1071&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;1071&quot; data-start=&quot;1022&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Thể hiện đẳng cấp và phong cách sống tiện nghi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1278&quot; data-start=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1105&quot; data-start=&quot;1076&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1103&quot; data-start=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;Đáp ứng nhu cầu đa dạng&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n	&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1278&quot; data-start=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;li data-end=&quot;1278&quot; data-start=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;\r\n		&lt;p data-end=&quot;1278&quot; data-start=&quot;1111&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Từ &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1137&quot; data-start=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;thang máy tải khách&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1161&quot; data-start=&quot;1139&quot;&gt;thang máy tải hàng&lt;/strong&gt;, đến &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1190&quot; data-start=&quot;1167&quot;&gt;thang máy bệnh viện&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1214&quot; data-start=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;thang máy quan sát&lt;/strong&gt;… đều có mặt tại Nhân Phát, phù hợp cho từng mục đích sử dụng.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n		&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1283&quot; data-start=&quot;1280&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1355&quot; data-start=&quot;1285&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;🔧 Dịch vụ lắp đặt thang máy tại Quận Tân Bình của &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1353&quot; data-start=&quot;1340&quot;&gt;Nhân Phát&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1751&quot; data-start=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1471&quot; data-start=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1471&quot; data-start=&quot;1359&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1392&quot; data-start=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Tư vấn – Khảo sát – Thiết kế:&lt;/strong&gt; Đội ngũ kỹ sư khảo sát tận nơi, đưa ra giải pháp tối ưu cho từng công trình.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1564&quot; data-start=&quot;1472&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1564&quot; data-start=&quot;1474&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1495&quot; data-start=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Lắp đặt trọn gói:&lt;/strong&gt; Cung cấp thiết bị, lắp đặt nhanh chóng, đảm bảo an toàn tuyệt đối.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1649&quot; data-start=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1649&quot; data-start=&quot;1567&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1599&quot; data-start=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Bảo trì &amp; Bảo dưỡng định kỳ:&lt;/strong&gt; Duy trì vận hành ổn định, xử lý sự cố kịp thời.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1751&quot; data-start=&quot;1650&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1751&quot; data-start=&quot;1652&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1675&quot; data-start=&quot;1652&quot;&gt;Nâng cấp – cải tạo:&lt;/strong&gt; Thay mới linh kiện, nâng cấp thang máy cũ để đáp ứng tiêu chuẩn hiện đại.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1756&quot; data-start=&quot;1753&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1825&quot; data-start=&quot;1758&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;🌟 Ưu điểm khi chọn &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1805&quot; data-start=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Thang Máy Nhân Phát&lt;/strong&gt; tại Quận Tân Bình&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2267&quot; data-start=&quot;1827&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;1922&quot; data-start=&quot;1827&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;1922&quot; data-start=&quot;1829&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1853&quot; data-start=&quot;1829&quot;&gt;Kinh nghiệm lâu năm:&lt;/strong&gt; Đã thi công hàng trăm công trình thang máy tại TP.HCM và các tỉnh.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2021&quot; data-start=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2021&quot; data-start=&quot;1925&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1949&quot; data-start=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;Thiết bị chính hãng:&lt;/strong&gt; Thang máy đạt tiêu chuẩn quốc tế, linh kiện nhập khẩu chất lượng cao.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2097&quot; data-start=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2097&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2045&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot;&gt;Giá cả minh bạch:&lt;/strong&gt; Chi phí hợp lý, báo giá rõ ràng, không phát sinh.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2176&quot; data-start=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2176&quot; data-start=&quot;2100&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2128&quot; data-start=&quot;2100&quot;&gt;Dịch vụ hậu mãi chu đáo:&lt;/strong&gt; Có mặt nhanh chóng khi khách hàng cần hỗ trợ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;2267&quot; data-start=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;2267&quot; data-start=&quot;2179&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2205&quot; data-start=&quot;2179&quot;&gt;Thi công đúng tiến độ:&lt;/strong&gt; Không làm ảnh hưởng đến sinh hoạt hay hoạt động kinh doanh.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;2272&quot; data-start=&quot;2269&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-end=&quot;2513&quot; data-start=&quot;2274&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;👉 Với đội ngũ kỹ thuật viên chuyên môn cao, phong cách làm việc tận tâm, &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2389&quot; data-start=&quot;2348&quot;&gt;Công ty TNHH XD &amp; Thang Máy Nhân Phát&lt;/strong&gt; cam kết mang đến cho khách hàng tại Quận Tân Bình những giải pháp &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2510&quot; data-start=&quot;2456&quot;&gt;thang máy an toàn – chất lượng – bền bỉ – hiện đại&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;77&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Các loại thang máy phổ biến phù hợp cho công trình tại Quận Tân Bình&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=&quot;333&quot; data-start=&quot;79&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Quận Tân Bình có sự đa dạng về công trình từ &lt;strong data-end=&quot;195&quot; data-start=&quot;124&quot;&gt;nhà ở dân dụng, khách sạn, văn phòng cho thuê, trung tâm thương mại&lt;/strong&gt; đến &lt;strong data-end=&quot;226&quot; data-start=&quot;200&quot;&gt;các khu y tế – dịch vụ&lt;/strong&gt;. Vì vậy, nhu cầu thang máy cũng rất phong phú. Dưới đây là những loại thang máy được sử dụng nhiều nhất:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-end=&quot;333&quot; data-start=&quot;79&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;https://thangmaynhanphat.com/upload/filemanager/files/B%C3%ACnh%20T%C3%A2n/B%E1%BA%A3o%20tr%C3%AC%20thang%20m%C3%A1y%20qu%E1%BA%ADn%20B%C3%ACnh%20T%C3%A2n.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width: 894px; height: 1175px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;338&quot; data-start=&quot;335&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-end=&quot;372&quot; data-start=&quot;340&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;1. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;370&quot; data-start=&quot;348&quot;&gt;Thang máy gia đình&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-end=&quot;608&quot; data-start=&quot;373&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;419&quot; data-start=&quot;373&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;419&quot; data-start=&quot;375&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Phù hợp với nhà phố, biệt thự từ 3–7 tầng.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;462&quot; data-start=&quot;420&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;462&quot; data-start=&quot;422&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Thiết kế nhỏ gọn, tiết kiệm diện tích.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;541&quot; data-start=&quot;463&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;541&quot; data-start=&quot;465&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Có nhiều lựa chọn: thang máy kính, thang máy nội thất gỗ, inox sang trọng.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-end=&quot;608&quot; data-start=&quot;542&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;p data-end=&quot;608&quot; data-start=&quot;544&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;Tải trọng từ 250kg – 450kg, đáp ứng nhu cầu 3–6 người sử dụng.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr data-end=&quot;613&quot; data-start=&quot;610&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-end=&quot;673&quot; data-start=&quot;615&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;&quot;&gt;2. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;671&quot; data-start=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Thang máy tải khá