;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Tất cả các loại hố pit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n			&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chi phí tham khảo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Giao động khoảng 80.000 - 150.000 đồng/m²&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thi công lớp chống thấm thuận &amp; lớp chống thấm ngược&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Chống thấm thuận là kỹ thuật thi công lớp chống thấm ở mặt ngoài công trình, nơi tiếp xúc trực tiếp với đất, nước ngầm hoặc mưa ngầm, giúp ngăn nước thấm từ bên ngoài vào kết cấu bê tông.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Ngược lại, chống thấm ngược được thực hiện ở mặt trong công trình, theo hướng ngược với dòng thấm của nước, thường áp dụng cho lòng hố pit thang máy hoặc các vị trí không thể xử lý từ bên ngoài.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;width:800px;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tiêu chí&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chống thấm thuận&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chống thấm ngược&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Vị trí thi công&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;ul&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Mặt ngoài kết cấu (tiếp xúc trực tiếp với nguồn nước)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n			&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;ul&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Mặt trong kết cấu ( không tiếp xúc với nguồn nước)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n			&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Cơ chế hoạt động&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;ul&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Ngăn nước từ bên ngoài&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n			&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;ul&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Ngăn nước thấm vào bên trong &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n			&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Ưu điểm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;ul&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Ngăn nước triệt để&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Độ bền cao&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Bảo vệ tổng thể kết cấu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n			&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;ul&gt;\r\n				&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&