yle=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Báo giá dịch vụ đánh bóng thang máy cho gia đình trên 10 tầng&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Đối với các công trình nhà ở, văn phòng tư nhân hoặc căn hộ thông tầng cao cấp có quy mô trên 10 tầng, thang máy thường có tần suất sử dụng lớn và đòi hỏi kỹ thuật đánh bóng chuyên sâu hơn. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;width:800px;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hạng mục công việc&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ĐVT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Đơn giá (VNĐ)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n			&lt;/td&gt;\r\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n		&lt;tr&gt;\r\n			&lt;td&gt;\r\n			&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&q